{"id": "seq_product_nonzero", "signature": "solve(nums)", "statement": "Return the product of all non-zero numbers in nums. If there are none, return 1.", "tests": [{"args": [[]], "expected": 1}, {"args": [[0]], "expected": 1}, {"args": [[7]], "expected": 7}, {"args": [[-4]], "expected": -4}, {"args": [[1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]], "expected": 720}, {"args": [[-3, -2, -1, 0, 1, 2, 3]], "expected": -36}, {"args": [[5, 5, 5]], "expected": 125}, {"args": [[-9, 4, 0, 13, -8]], "expected": 3744}, {"args": [[31, 19, 17, 25, 35, -16, -17, 25, 20, 40, 38, -17, -28, 17, -2, -22, -29, 28, -35, 36, 10, 17, 38, -20, 39, -39, 27, -32, -33, -36, -16, -10, 36]], "expected": -766539051013100024854853510076825600000000000}, {"args": [[19, 1, 16, 35, -15, 26]], "expected": -4149600}, {"args": [[-3, 23, -40, -30, 18, -5, 12, 30, -30, -8, 0, -11, 25, -4, -37, -32, 32, -27, 11]], "expected": -7969616139386880000000}, {"args": [[-3, 9, -32, -38, -40, -13, -14, -34, 20, 8, 10]], "expected": -13002522624000}], "facts": [["arg", "nums", "int_list"], ["iterate", "nums"], ["keep", "nonzero"], ["aggregate", "product"], ["size", "nums", "tiny"]], "cost_exempt": "product of n integers is an integer with O(n) digits; big-integer multiplication makes any implementation superlinear", "deps": {"schema": ["seq_fold"], "uses": [], "solution_sha256": "958b5e4222b86cd37daaac1e56e5f47b1ea43033c8cf2ce60c8186ebc2555c45", "reference_sha256": "6736fa24d28299d2b149692238b5fc60a9a2365e45e79094899971461c10a464"}}